{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_ttr_42_1","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_42","textTraditional":"【經】","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_ttr_42_2","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_42","textTraditional":"十有三年春，齊侯、宋人、陳人、蔡人、邾人會于北杏。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_ttr_42_3","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_42","textTraditional":"夏六月，齊人滅遂。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_ttr_42_4","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_42","textTraditional":"秋七月。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_ttr_42_5","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_42","textTraditional":"冬，公會齊侯盟于柯。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_ttr_42_6","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_42","textTraditional":"【傳】","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_ttr_42_7","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_42","textTraditional":"十三年春，會于北杏，以平宋亂。遂人不至。夏，齊人滅遂而戍之。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_ttr_42_8","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_42","textTraditional":"冬，盟于柯，始及齊平也。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_ttr_42_9","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_42","textTraditional":"宋人背北杏之會。","sentenceOrder":9}],"overrides":{}}